id: BUILD-043
ilities: [modularity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: CJS .default import interop issue
category: build
severity: warning
engine: presence
target:
  extensions: .ts .js
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: require(
patterns:
  - regex: require\(\s*['"][^'"]+['"]\s*\)\.default
    message: ".default after require() — indicates ESM/CJS interop mismatch, module may not have a default export"
fix: Use import syntax for ESM modules, or check the module's actual export format. Configure esModuleInterop in tsconfig.
